# A try too far from the mark says so. Same set turn as soma-skate-quick-set, but you pop 3.34 m
# before the mark (inside spot.near, 5 m, outside spot.radius, 2 m): a clean Ollie, yet the set
# misses with reason "too far from the mark" (and at 3.34) instead of waiting for the clock.
park soma
cmd 0 run skate kenji
hold up 592..712
hold ollie 712..742
run 1000
expect event pop within 740..746
expect event land{quality=clean} within 855..863
expect event skateSetMiss{by=player,reason=too far from the mark,got=ollie,at=3.34} within 855..863
expect event skateTurn{who=local,role=set} within 855..863
expect no event skateSet{by=player}
